| 2 | 9.701e-03 | 9.701e-03 | 9.638e-03 |
| 3 | 4.296e-03 | 4.296e-03 | 4.284e-03 |
| 4 | 2.413e-03 | 2.413e-03 | 2.410e-03 |
| 5 | 1.544e-03 | 1.544e-03 | 1.542e-03 |
| 6 | 1.072e-03 | 1.072e-03 | 1.071e-03 |
